{"id": "v8-multi-001-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-001", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "I left a spare key with the caretaker. Please ask for it only if neither of us can get home before you arrive.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-001-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-001", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "我把一把备用钥匙交给管理员了。只有我们两个人都不能在你到达之前回到家时，你才去找管理员要钥匙。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-002-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-002", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "The parcel has already been collected by a neighbour. You do not need to visit the collection point, but please bring the receipt home.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-002-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-002", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "包裹已经由一位邻居取走了。你不必去取件点，但请把收据带回家。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-003-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-003", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "We can move the meeting to the afternoon if everyone agrees. Until then, keep the original time in the shared calendar.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-003-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-003", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "如果大家都同意，我们可以把会议改到下午。在那之前，共享日历里仍保留原定时间。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-004-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-004", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "The hinge has come loose again. Hold the door steady while I tighten the screws, and keep your fingers away from the gap.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-004-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-004", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "铰链又松了。我拧紧螺丝时，请把门扶稳，并让手指远离门缝。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-005-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-005", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "Please fold the blanket rather than pushing it into the cupboard. The shelf can hold it, but the bottom drawer is still damp.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-005-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-005", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "请把毯子叠好，不要直接塞进柜子。它可以放在搁板上，但最下面的抽屉仍然潮湿。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-006-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-006", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "The notice says the lift will be inspected tomorrow morning. That does not mean it will remain unavailable for the whole day.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-006-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-006", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "通知说电梯明天上午会接受检查。这并不意味着它一整天都不能使用。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-007-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-007", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "I have renamed the document Quiet Beacon. Please use that name in the minutes, even though the folder still has the old name.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {"Quiet Beacon": "静谧信标"}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-007-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-007", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "我把文档重新命名为静谧信标了。虽然文件夹仍用旧名称，请在会议纪要里使用这个新名称。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {"静谧信标": "Quiet Beacon"}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-008-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-008", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "The floor is dry now, but the cleaning sign is still outside. Could you bring it in after checking that nobody needs it?", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-008-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-008", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "地板现在已经干了，但清洁提示牌还放在外面。确认没人需要它之后，你能把它拿进来吗？", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-009-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-009", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "The boat leaves from the smaller pier beside the warehouse. Tickets bought online are valid there, so you do not need to exchange them first.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-009-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-009", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "船从仓库旁较小的码头出发。网上买的票在那里有效，因此你不必先换票。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-010-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-010", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "The museum admits visitors until an hour before closing. If you arrive later than that, your reservation alone will not let you enter.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-010-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-010", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "博物馆在关门前一小时停止接待入场游客。如果你再晚到，仅凭预约也不能进去。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-011-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-011", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "Keep the trail marker on your left until the path divides. Take the wider branch there, not the narrow path leading uphill.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-011-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-011", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "在小路分岔之前，让路标一直位于你的左侧。在分岔处走较宽的那条，不要走通向山上的窄路。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-012-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-012", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "Our room faces the courtyard rather than the street. Could we keep the same room for the extra night, even if breakfast costs more?", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-012-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-012", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "我们的房间朝向庭院，不朝向街道。即使早餐更贵，多住一晚时我们能继续住同一间房吗？", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-013-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-013", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "The timetable shows two departures, but only the later one runs on Sundays. Please check the day before choosing your connection.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-013-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-013", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "时刻表上列了两班出发时间，但星期日只有较晚的那班运行。选择接续班次前，请核对一下日期。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-014-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-014", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "The day pass includes the lookout tower. It does not include the guided walk, which must be booked separately.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-014-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-014", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "日票包括瞭望塔。它不包括导览步行活动，那项活动必须另行预约。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-015-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-015", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "We are following the Cedar Loop route. Keep that route name on the translated map so our group can identify it at each junction.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {"Cedar Loop": "雪松环线"}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-015-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-015", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "我们正在沿雪松环线行进。请在翻译后的地图上保留这个路线名称，让我们这一组在每个岔路口都能辨认它。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {"雪松环线": "Cedar Loop"}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-016-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-016", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "The driver can stop near the eastern gate if the road is clear. If it is blocked, we will get off at the main square instead.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-016-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-016", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "如果道路畅通，司机可以在东门附近停车。如果道路被堵住，我们就改在主广场下车。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-017-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-017", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "Toast the seeds in a dry pan until they smell fragrant. Let them cool before grinding them, rather than adding water while they are hot.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-017-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-017", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "把种子放在干锅里炒香。等它们冷却后再研磨，不要趁热加水。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-018-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-018", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "This dough needs another rest before it is rolled out. Cover it loosely so the surface does not dry out while we prepare the filling.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-018-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-018", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "这团面团还需要静置一次才能擀开。我们准备馅料时，把它轻轻盖住，以免表面变干。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-019-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-019", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "The dressing contains mustard, but the roasted vegetables do not. Please serve the dressing separately so each person can decide whether to add it.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-019-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-019", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "调味汁里有芥末，但烤蔬菜里没有。请把调味汁另外盛放，让每个人自行决定是否添加。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-020-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-020", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "The rice at the bottom is slightly crisp, not burnt. Lift it gently with a spatula instead of scraping the coating of the pan.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-020-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-020", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "底部的米饭略微发脆，没有烧焦。用锅铲轻轻铲起米饭，不要刮到锅的涂层。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-021-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-021", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "We have enough filling for one more batch. Make smaller portions if you want it to last, but do not change the cooking time without checking.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-021-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-021", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "馅料还够再做一批。如果想让馅料用得更久，就把每份做小些，但不要未经核对就改变烹调时间。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-022-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-022", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "The beans should be drained before they go into the salad. Save some of the cooking liquid in case the mixture needs loosening later.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-022-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-022", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "豆子放进沙拉之前应先沥干。留一些煮豆子的水，以备之后需要把混合物调稀。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-023-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-023", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "The menu calls this sauce Golden Orchard. Use that name for the sauce, but translate the list of ingredients in the usual way.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {"Golden Orchard": "金色果园"}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-023-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-023", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "菜单把这种酱叫作金色果园。酱的名称请使用这个译名，但配料表按通常方式翻译。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {"金色果园": "Golden Orchard"}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-024-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-024", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "The tart is firm enough to slice after it cools. Before that, moving it off the tray could break the base.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-024-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-024", "category": "food", "input": {"text": "馅饼冷却后就会变得足够结实，可以切片。在那之前，把它从托盘上移走可能会弄碎底部。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-025-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-025", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "The approximation is useful when the changes are small. For larger changes, we must use the original equation rather than extending the same rule.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-025-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-025", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "变化较小时，这种近似很有用。变化较大时，我们必须使用原来的方程，不能沿用同一条规则。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-026-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-026", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "The sample was weighed before and after drying. A lower final mass indicates that material was lost, but it does not identify which material left.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-026-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-026", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "样品在干燥前后都称过重量。最终质量较低说明有物质损失，但不能据此确定损失的是哪种物质。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-027-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-027", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "The survey records whether respondents chose either option. It does not record how strongly they preferred the option they selected.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-027-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-027", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "调查记录受访者是否选择了两个选项中的某一个。它不记录受访者对所选选项的偏好有多强。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-028-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-028", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "The function accepts an empty list but rejects a missing argument. Those cases must remain separate in the documentation and in the tests.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
