{"id": "v8-multi-030-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-030", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "The estimate has a wide uncertainty interval because the sample is small. Collecting more independent observations may narrow it, but repeating the same observation does not add independence.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-030-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-030", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "由于样本较小，估计值的不确定区间较宽。收集更多独立观测可能会缩小这个区间，但重复同一次观测并不会增加独立性。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-031-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-031", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "The report calls this measure boundary retention. Use the agreed term throughout the summary, and do not shorten it to retention when another measure could be confused with it.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {"boundary retention": "边界保留度"}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-031-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-031", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "报告把这个指标称为边界保留度。摘要中请始终使用约定的术语；如果可能与另一个指标混淆，就不要把它缩写成保留度。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {"边界保留度": "boundary retention"}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-032-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-032", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "The two groups were observed at different times. A difference between their results cannot by itself establish that the intervention caused the change.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-032-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-032", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "这两组是在不同时间接受观测的。仅凭它们结果之间的差异，不能确定变化是由干预造成的。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-033-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-033", "category": "hard", "input": {"text": "This is a tall order. We cannot promise to finish it by Friday.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "A team is discussing a demanding request, not the physical height of an order.", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-033-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-033", "category": "hard", "input": {"text": "这是一项艰巨的任务。我们不能保证在星期五之前完成。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "A team is discussing a demanding request, not the physical height of an order.", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-034-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-034", "category": "hard", "input": {"text": "Do not spill the beans. We agreed to wait until everyone arrives.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "The speakers are planning a surprise and want its details kept secret.", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-034-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-034", "category": "hard", "input": {"text": "不要泄露秘密。我们说好了等所有人到齐。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "The speakers are planning a surprise and want its details kept secret.", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-035-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-035", "category": "hard", "input": {"text": "The ball is in your court. We will wait for your decision before making another change.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "The speakers are discussing responsibility for a decision, not a sports match.", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-035-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-035", "category": "hard", "input": {"text": "现在该由你来决定了。我们会等你作出决定后再进行另一项改动。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "The speakers are discussing responsibility for a decision, not a sports match.", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v8-multi-036-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-036", "category": "hard", "input": {"text": "Let's put this on ice. We can return to it once the figures have been checked.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "A proposal is being postponed; no physical cooling or storage is involved.", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
